+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+No current decision on the transport compression codec is recorded for this project. A decision recording zstd as the codec was previously tracked in `config/decisions/revoke-compression.json`, but that file was removed from the repository in commit 6cade23 ("move decision config out of the tree") without a replacement value being recorded anywhere in the tree, so there is presently no recorded codec choice to state.
